ard\",\"done_label\":\"Done\",\"done_url\":\"\"}',3,1,'2026-10-12 00:03:38','2026-10-12 00:03:38'),(49,1,'event_countdown','Event countdown','{\"heading\":\"\",\"subheading\":\"Next summit\",\"show_venue\":true,\"show_registration\":true,\"button_text\":\"Register now\",\"button_url\":\"registration\",\"finished_text\":\"The summit is happening now!\"}',12,0,'2026-10-12 00:13:53','2026-10-13 01:07:39'),(198,1,'hero','Event hero','{\"kicker\":\"Stronger Together\",\"title\":\"\",\"highlight\":\"Cancer Summit\",\"theme\":\"Uniting cancer care professionals from around the world to share the latest evidence, advanced therapies and practical experience \\u2014 to improve the quality of life of people living with cancer.\",\"image\":\"assets\\/frontend\\/images\\/gallery\\/Bics2023-2.jpg\",\"show_countdown\":true,\"countdown_title\":\"The summit starts in\",\"finished_text\":\"The summit is happening now!\",\"button1_text\":\"\",\"button1_url\":\"registration\",\"button2_text\":\"Programme & details\",\"button2_url\":\"upcomming-bics\"}',2,1,'2026-10-12 21:38:44','2026-10-13 01:07:39'),(199,1,'stats','Key numbers','{\"eyebrow\":\"\",\"heading\":\"BICS at a glance\",\"intro\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"value\":\"4\",\"label\":\"Editions of BICS\",\"icon\":\"bi-award\"},{\"value\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Host countries so far\",\"icon\":\"bi-globe2\"},{\"value\":\"{registrations}+\",\"label\":\"Professionals registered online\",\"icon\":\"bi-people\"},{\"value\":\"{countries}\",\"label\":\"Countries represented\",\"icon\":\"bi-flag\"}],\"anchor\":\"\",\"background\":\"dark\"}',3,1,'2026-10-12 21:38:44','2026-10-13 01:07:39'),(200,1,'cards','What the summit covers','{\"eyebrow\":\"Why attend\",\"heading\":\"What the summit covers\",\"intro\":\"Four themes guide every BICS programme.\",\"columns\":\"4\",\"items\":[{\"image\":\"\",\"icon\":\"bi-clipboard2-pulse\",\"title\":\"Best practice in treatment\",\"text\":\"An open platform for oncologists and care teams to discuss what works in cancer treatment today.\",\"link\":\"\"},{\"image\":\"\",\"icon\":\"bi-capsule\",\"title\":\"Advanced therapies\",\"text\":\"Knowledge and real-world experience of using advanced medications in cancer management.\",\"link\":\"\"},{\"image\":\"\",\"icon\":\"bi-people\",\"title\":\"Networking & capacity building\",\"text\":\"Building cancer care capacity through collaboration between professionals and institutions.\",\"link\":\"\"},{\"image\":\"\",\"icon\":\"bi-search-heart\",\"title\":\"Early detection\",\"text\":\"Raising awareness of early detection \\u2014 one of the most effective ways to improve outcomes.\",\"link\":\"\"}],\"anchor\":\"\",\"background\":\"soft\"}',5,1,'2026-10-12 21:38:44','2026-10-13 01:07:39'),(201,1,'speakers','Speakers','{\"eyebrow\":\"Faculty\",\"heading\":\"Speakers\",\"intro\":\"International experts in oncology and cancer care.\",\"items\":[],\"empty_title\":\"Speakers to be announced\",\"empty_text\":\"Our faculty of international cancer care experts will be announced here soon.\",\"anchor\":\"speakers\",\"background\":\"white\"}',6,1,'2026-10-12 21:38:44','2026-10-13 01:07:39'),(202,1,'venue','Venue','{\"eyebrow\":\"Venue\",\"heading\":\"Where we meet\",\"intro\":\"\",\"venue_name\":\"\",\"address\":\"\",\"media\":\"map\",\"image\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"icon\":\"bi-qr-code-scan\",\"title\":\"Fast check-in\",\"text\":\"Show the QR code from your confirmation email at the registration desk.\"},{\"icon\":\"bi-person-badge\",\"title\":\"Your ID card\",\"text\":\"Your personal ID card (PDF) is linked in your confirmation email.\"},{\"icon\":\"bi-headset\",\"title\":\"Need help?\",\"text\":\"Contact the BICS team for any question about your visit.\"}],\"anchor\":\"venue\",\"background\":\"soft\"}',7,1,'2026-10-12 21:38:44','2026-10-13 01:07:39'),(203,1,'past_events','Past summits','{\"eyebrow\":\"Our journey\",\"heading\":\"Summits so far\",\"intro\":\"From Tanzania to Spain \\u2014 a growing community of cancer care professionals.\",\"items\":[{\"image\":\"assets\\/frontend\\/images\\/gallery\\/bics-tanzania-13.jpg\",\"year\":\"2021\",\"edition\":\"BICS 2021\",\"city\":\"Tanzania\",\"theme\":\"Cancer Care in the Era of Advanced Therapeutics\",\"link\":\"gallery\",\"upcoming\":false},{\"image\":\"assets\\/frontend\\/images\\/gallery\\/Bics2023-2.jpg\",\"year\":\"2023\",\"edition\":\"BICS 2023\",\"city\":\"Algeria\",\"theme\":\"\",\"link\":\"gallery\",\"upcoming\":false},{\"image\":\"\",\"year\":\"2024\",\"edition\":\"3rd BICS\",\"city\":\"Palma de Mallorca, Spain\",\"theme\":\"Conquering Cancer With Advanced Therapies\",\"link\":\"\",\"upcoming\":false},{\"image\":\"\",\"year\":\"2026\",\"edition\":\"4th BICS \\u00b7 Next\",\"city\":\"Valencia, Spain\",\"theme\":\"Join us for the next summit.\",\"link\":\"registration\",\"upcoming\":true}],\"anchor\":\"past-summits\",\"background\":\"white\"}',8,1,'2026-10-12 21:38:44','2026-10-13 01:07:39'),(204,1,'faq','FAQ','{\"eyebrow\":\"FAQ\",\"heading\":\"Good to know\",\"intro\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"question\":\"Who can attend BICS?\",\"answer\":\"BICS is a summit for cancer care professionals \\u2014 oncologists, doctors, pharmacists, nurses, researchers and others working in cancer care. Choose your profession and speciality on the registration form.\"},{\"question\":\"How do I register?\",\"answer\":\"Fill in the online registration form. It takes a few minutes. When you finish you get a registration number on screen and a confirmation email with your personal ID card.\"},{\"question\":\"I did not receive the confirmation email. What should I do?\",\"answer\":\"Check your spam or junk folder first. If it is not there, contact us with the name and email address you registered with and we will send it again.\"},{\"question\":\"What should I bring on the day?\",\"answer\":\"Bring your registration number or the QR code from your confirmation email (on your phone or printed). The registration desk scans it to check you in quickly.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I register for more than one summit?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. You can register for each BICS summit with the same email address \\u2014 one registration per person per summit.\"},{\"question\":\"Where can I see photos from previous summits?\",\"answer\":\"Visit the Gallery for photos from earlier BICS summits.\"}],\"help_title\":\"Still have a question?\",\"help_text\":\"The BICS team is happy to help with registration, travel or anything else.\",\"button_text\":\"Contact us\",\"button_url\":\"contact-us\",\"anchor\":\"faq\",\"background\":\"white\"}',10,1,'2026-10-12 21:38:44','2026-10-13 01:07:39'),(205,1,'cta','Register banner','{\"eyebrow\":\"Stronger together\",\"title\":\"Ready to join the next summit?\",\"text\":\"Register online in a few minutes \\u2014 your confirmation email includes your registration number, QR code and ID card.\",\"button_text\":\"Register now\",\"button_url\":\"registration\",\"anchor\":\"\",\"background\":\"white\"}',11,1,'2026-10-12 21:38:44','2026-10-13 01:07:39'),(206,2,'page_header','Page header','{\"eyebrow\":\"About\",\"title\":\"About BICS\",\"subtitle\":\"The Beacon International Cancer Summit brings cancer care professionals together to improve the quality of life of people living with cancer.\",\"image\":\"assets\\/frontend\\/images\\/gallery\\/bics-tanzania-13.jpg\"}',1,1,'2026-10-12 21:38:44','2026-10-12 21:38:44'),(207,2,'about','What is BICS / Objectives','{\"eyebrow\":\"Who we are\",\"left_title\":\"What is BICS?\",\"left_body\":\"<p><span class=\\\"text-danger fw-bold\\\">Beacon International Cancer Summit (BICS) <\\/span>is a global Summit organized by Beacon Pharma Ltd to unite cancer care professionals to improve quality of life of the cancer patients through exchanging latest information and innovative ideas in cancer treatments. <\\/p>\",\"button_text\":\"Register for the next summit\",\"button_url\":\"registration\",\"right_title\":\"Objectives:\",\"right_items\":[{\"text\":\"Creating an open platform to discuss the best practices in cancer treatment\"},{\"text\":\"Sharing knowledge and experience of using advanced medications in cancer management\"},{\"text\":\"Capacity building in cancer care through networking & collaboration\"},{\"text\":\"Building awareness for early detection of cancer\"}],\"anchor\":\"objectives\",\"background\":\"white\"}',2,1,'2026-10-12 21:38:44','2026-10-12 21:38:44'),(208,2,'cards','Focus areas','{\"eyebrow\":\"Focus\",\"heading\":\"What the summit covers\",\"intro\":\"\",\"columns\":\"4\",\"items\":[{\"image\":\"\",\"icon\":\"bi-clipboard2-pulse\",\"title\":\"Best practice in treatment\",\"text\":\"An open platform for oncologists and care teams to discuss what works in cancer treatment today.\",\"link\":\"\"},{\"image\":\"\",\"icon\":\"bi-capsule\",\"title\":\"Advanced therapies\",\"text\":\"Knowledge and real-world experience of using advanced medications in cancer management.\",\"link\":\"\"},{\"image\":\"\",\"icon\":\"bi-people\",\"title\":\"Networking & capacity building\",\"text\":\"Building cancer care capacity through collaboration between professionals and institutions.\",\"link\":\"\"},{\"image\":\"\",\"icon\":\"bi-search-heart\",\"title\":\"Early detection\",\"text\":\"Raising awareness of early detection \\u2014 one of the most effective ways to improve outcomes.\",\"link\":\"\"}],\"anchor\":\"\",\"background\":\"soft\"}',3,1,'2026-10-12 21:38:44','2026-10-12 21:38:44'),(209,2,'stats','Key numbers','{\"eyebrow\":\"\",\"heading\":\"BICS at a glance\",\"intro\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"value\":\"4\",\"label\":\"Editions of BICS\",\"icon\":\"bi-award\"},{\"value\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Host countries so far\",\"icon\":\"bi-globe2\"},{\"value\":\"{registrations}+\",\"label\":\"Professionals registered online\",\"icon\":\"bi-people\"},{\"value\":\"{countries}\",\"label\":\"Countries represented\",\"icon\":\"bi-flag\"}],\"anchor\":\"\",\"background\":\"dark\"}',4,1,'2026-10-12 21:38:44','2026-10-12 21:38:44'),(210,2,'past_events','Past summits','{\"eyebrow\":\"Our journ